HH:MM:SS.00 format.

Note: indefinite display is controlled through the Loops data field."

[node name="Loop" parent="UI/VBox/VSplit/Middle/HSplit/EditArea/HBox/Editor/ScrollContainer/VBox/Image/Data" unique_id=1248201429 node_paths=PackedStringArray("parent_container") instance=ExtResource("2_guh61")]
